 R←Test_UC_NuGet_001(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempFolder;parms;I;rc;msg
⍝ *** WARNING: want to rename this fn? Keep in mind to rename the "∆"-prefixed twin as well:
⍝ ***          the process started here runs the function called "∆",(this function's name).
⍝ Exercise ]Cider.AddNuGetDependencies and ListNuGetDependencies
⍝ The real test function (∆Test_UC_NuGet_001) is executed in its own APL process
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 :If ~∆DotNetIsAvailable
     R←T._NotApplicable
 :EndIf

 tempFolder←∆GetFolderInTempDir⊃⎕SI
 parms←∆NuGetTestProcessParms(⊃⎕SI)tempFolder
 I←APLProcess.New parms
 :If I.ExitCode=130
     R←T._OK
 :EndIf

∆TidyUp:
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempFolder
 msg Assert 0=rc
⍝Done
